+normalized, holomorphic canonical solutions on suitable half-planes, with
+explicit bounds on their remainders, and displays the resulting Stokes
+geometry.  These sectorial solutions supply outer building blocks for a
+future origin-to-infinity connection; they do not by themselves determine
+Stokes multipliers, the Bargmann determinant, or eigenvalue asymptotics.
